["WHY PROGRAMMABILITY MATTERS"]}, {"tag": "h2", "attrs": {}, "children": ["Simulated frequency coverage with missing channels"]}, {"tag": "p", "attrs": {"class": "prose"}, "children": ["A simulated example disables channels 2 and 10. Shifting and widening neighbouring channels restores electrical coverage of the missing frequency bands. This demonstrates the value of reconfiguration without claiming a measured improvement in a patient’s hearing."]}, {"tag": "figure", "attrs": {"class": "research-figure "}, "children": [{"tag": "a", "attrs": {"href": "/assets/band-recovery.webp", "class": "figure-open", "data-caption": "Simulated lost-band recovery", "aria-label": "Enlarge figure: Simulated lost-band recovery"}, "children": [{"tag": "img", "attrs": {"class": "", "src": "/assets/band-recovery.webp", "width": "1213", "height": "897", "alt": "Simulated lost-band recovery", "loading": "lazy", "decoding": "async"}, "children": []}, {"tag": "span", "attrs": {"class": "enlarge"}, "children": ["Enlarge ↗"]}]}, {"tag": "figcaption", "attrs": {}, "children": [{"tag": "strong", "attrs": {}, "children": ["Simulated lost-band recovery"]}, {"tag": "p", "attrs": {}, "children": ["Original comparison of normal operation, missing channels and reconfigured neighbouring filters. The result demonstrates electrical frequency-band coverage."]}, {"tag": "a", "attrs": {"class": "source", "href": "/documents/Berkay_Ozbek_MSc_Thesis.pdf#page=115", "target": "_blank", "rel": "noopener"}, "children": ["MSc thesis · Fig. 3.44 · p. 97 ", {"tag": "span", "attrs": {"aria-hidden": "true"}, "children": ["↗"]}]}]}]}, "\n", {"tag": "aside", "attrs": {"class": "evidence-note"}, "children": [{"tag": "h3", "attrs": {}, "children": ["The next integration step"]}, {"tag": "p", "attrs": {}, "children": ["The full front-end still requires silicon measurement and integration with the acoustic sensor and stimulation electronics. The thesis also identifies input dynamic range at high sound levels and low-frequency sensing sensitivity as areas for improvement."]}]}, "\n"]}, {"tag": "div", "attrs": {"class": "related"}, "children": [{"tag": "div", "attrs": {}, "children": [{"tag": "span", "attrs": {}, "children": ["THE RESEARCH THREAD"]}, {"tag": "h3", "attrs": {}, "children": ["Explore wireless power and telemetry"]}]}, {"tag": "a", "attrs": {"href": "/neurostreamx"}, "children": ["Explore the PhD system ↗"]}]}]}]}